-- THE REPEAL OF SCHEDULE B. Sefer HaChukim 2511 (30 November 2015), the Economic Efficiency Law for the 2015 and 2016 budget years.
-- The Subsection that holds the repeal is headed on p. 247 (read from the strip of that page image); p. 248, read from its strip, repeals s 33 and Schedule B; p. 249, read from its strip,
-- commences the National Insurance Law as worded in that Subsection on 20 Tevet 5776 = 1 January 2016 (date pair run through the calendar routine, which reproduced 30 Kislev 5785 = 31 December 2024 first).
-- ext:[SH 2511 p.247, read from the page image] | סימן ב': ניהול תקציבי
-- ext:[SH 2511 p.248, read from the page image] | (3) סעיף 33 – בטל; (4) לוח ב' – בטל.
-- ext:[SH 2511 p.249, read from the page image] | 31. תחילתו של חוק הביטוח הלאומי, כנוסחו בסימן זה, ביום כ' בטבת התשע"ו (1 בינואר 2016).

