-- CONTROL 1. Determining Income in Old-Age and Survivors Insurance Regulations, 5737-1976, regulation 1(ב): "הסכום הנקוב בלוח ט׳ לחוק".
-- These regulations were amended in 1993, 2003, 2005 and 2011 and cite the schedule by the lettering of 1995. Both limbs are the consolidation only: no instrument that wrote the words was read.
-- Limb (a) is also the consolidation only for today's text of the ninth schedule; the page image of the Law as enacted (p. 301, above) shows the same schedule under the same letter with items 1 to 3.
