`reference: income determination regs r 1(b), the ninth schedule` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` WITH
        `the citing words are in` IS "Determining Income in Old-Age and Survivors Insurance Regulations, regulation 1(ב), the words בלוח ט׳ לחוק"
        `the citing words say it points at` IS `the income schedule for the old-age pension, as a whole`
        `the target is` IS `the income schedule for the old-age pension, as a whole`
        `the target if the old lettering is read as the new` IS `the income schedule for the old-age pension, as a whole`
        `the cited item exists in the target as enacted` IS TRUE
        `the target was repealed from` IS NOTHING
        `limb (a) was read from` IS `the consolidation only`
        `limb (b) was read from` IS `the consolidation only`

